# Intrepid Paleontologist: "If you cast a spell this way, that creature enters with a finality counter on it." Only a spell cast with this
# permission: Bot1 casts the Nest Robber (a Dinosaur) from their hand with the Paleontologist on the battlefield, and it enters with no
# counter (CR 614.1c), so Lightning Bolt puts it into the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Intrepid Paleontologist
Nest Robber
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Intrepid Paleontologist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Nest Robber.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Nest Robber.Counters.Finality = (absent)
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Nest Robber)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Nest Robber = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard = Nest Robber; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Exile = 
